		{
			description: [
				"This book is your guide. It starts small on purpose: &enew chapters appear as you earn them&f, so what you see is always something you can do next."
				""
				"This chapter explains how the world works. Each page is a quick read and pays a little for it. None of it is required - skip ahead whenever you like."
				""
				"When you are ready to play, open &aFirst Days&f. When you want to choose a direction, open &6The Crossroads&f."
			]
			id: "651F9568F829CECF"
