		{
			dependencies: ["651F9568F829CECF"]
			description: [
				"&aCircles&f are steps, &ehexagons&f are milestones and &6pentagons&f open or finish something big."
				""
				"A quest you cannot see yet is behind one you have not finished. Whole chapters work the same way: finish the right quest and a new chapter appears in the list on the left."
				""
				"Rewards are not automatic - click a finished quest to claim, or use the chest button at the top to claim everything."
			]
