		{
			dependencies: ["44EAB87876375555"]
			description: [
				"The first time you open the skill trees (press &e,&f) you choose your &dmain tree&f. It earns experience faster, a share of every other tree's experience flows into it, and its deeds now and then drop coins. Only an operator can change it later."
				""
				"Every other tree is still open to you, just slower. Nothing in them is locked by your choice."
				""
				"&7Operators: /mastery main <player> <tree>"
