			description: [
				"Open your inventory, click the &6team&f button in the top-left corner, choose &eCreate Party&f and &eInvite&f the others."
				""
				"A party &ashares quest progress&f: one boss kill counts for everybody, and each of you still claims your own rewards. Without a party only the player who landed the killing blow gets the credit."
				""
				"MineColonies is separate - add friends as Officers in the Town Hall."
