		{
			dependencies: ["13D15F41F3D1ADB1"]
			description: [
				"There is a single stamina pool, and the wheel is it. Sprinting, swimming, gliding, climbing, parkour moves, dodging, weapon swings and blocking all draw from the same wheel."
				""
				"Empty it and you are &cexhausted&f (the wheel turns red): slow to swing, slow to dig and unable to dodge until it refills. Stop and it comes back quickly."
				""
				"&dSpirit Orbs&f from chests and spawners buy more: trade four at a &eGoddess Statue&f for a Stamina Vessel or a Heart Container."
			]
			icon: "paraglider:stamina_vessel"
