		{
			dependencies: ["63C79D5F83B551AA"]
			description: [
				"Spells cost &9mana&f, the blue bar above your hotbar. It refills by itself. &eIron's Spells&f and &eArs Nouveau&f both cast from this one bar, so a mage who uses both never juggles two pools."
				""
				"Robes, rings, enchantments, potions and skill nodes from &oeither&f mod make the bar bigger or faster to refill, and spell power helps both kinds of spell."
				""
				"Some magic runs on its own fuel instead: &cBlood Magic&f on life essence, &5Malum&f on spirits, &8Goety&f on souls in your focus, &6Eidolon&f on mana your patron grants at the altar, &eForbidden \\& Arcanus&f on aureal, and &9Mana and Artifice&f on a resource that depends on your faction. Each mod's chapter explains its own."
			]
			icon: "irons_spellbooks:mana_upgrade_orb"
			id: "33C9CB9B925D0C7A"
			rewards: [
