		}
		{
			dependencies: ["33C9CB9B925D0C7A"]
			description: [
				"&eLeft Ctrl&f sprints faster. &eC&f crawls. Run at a low wall to &evault&f it, hold &eright mouse&f against a ledge to cling, and press &eR&f as you land a long fall to roll out of it. Jump off a wall with &eSpace&f."
				""
				"&eLeft Alt&f is a quick dodge with a moment of invulnerability. Like everything else it costs &astamina&f from the wheel."
				""
				"A &eParaglider&f (found in the stone towers) opens when you jump in mid-air."
				""
				"&7Alt+P opens the parkour settings."
			]
			icon: "paraglider:paraglider"
