		{
			dependencies: ["7D7E1AC263F285C8"]
			description: [
				"Weapons have their own swings. Keep clicking to chain a combo; big weapons hit several enemies and take both hands, so no shield with a greatsword."
				""
				"Every swing and every block costs stamina. Running dry in the middle of a fight is how most heroes die."
				""
				"Monsters with a coloured name and stars are &cChampions&f: tougher, with special tricks, and they drop better loot."
				""
				"Bleeding ignores armour. Carry bandages."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:iron_sword"
