		{
			dependencies: ["2B5C796876A92698"]
			description: [
				"Almost every tool, weapon and armour piece rolls a &equality&f when it is made or found - from Broken to Legendary - that changes its stats."
				""
				"A &eReforging Station&f rerolls it. It costs the item's own material, so iron gear is rerolled with iron."
				""
				"Gear found in the world can also carry &dgem sockets&f and &daffixes&f. Those are Apotheosis, which has its own chapter later."
