		{
			dependencies: ["651F9568F829CECF"]
			description: [
				"There are fifteen, all open from the start, and each grows from &odoing&f its own thing: fighting, mining, travelling, cooking, building, casting - and from quests. The first time you open them you choose your &6main tree&f: it grows fastest, and takes a small share of everything the others earn."
				""
				"Gear is never locked behind a skill. Skills only add to what you already are."
				""
				"&eVein mining:&f hold the &e`&f key (left of 1) while you break an ore or a log and the rest of the vein comes with it. It starts at &e4 blocks&f; &6Vein Mining Size&f nodes in the Mining tree (Tunneling, Prospecting, Demolition) and the Forestry tree (Felling) make it bigger."
			]
