		{
			dependencies: ["7FA98625CB4FC5BB"]
			description: [
				"Your things are not scattered. They wait in a &egrave&f where you fell, and nobody else can open it."
				""
				"You respawn with a &eGrave Key&f that points the way back. Walk onto the grave to take everything back at once."
				""
				"Nothing despawns. Take your time."
				""
				"&e/back&f takes you to where you died (for 10 minutes after), or back to where you stood before your last teleport. Stand still and unhurt for 5 seconds while it works; it will not work within 15 seconds of taking damage."
			]
			icon: "tombstone:grave_key"
