		{
			dependencies: ["651F9568F829CECF"]
			description: [
				"Variety matters. Every &enew&f food you try counts towards extra hearts - check the Food Book for your progress."
				""
				"Sleeping leaves you &eWell Rested&f, and standing near a lit campfire slowly heals you."
				""
